docs/architecture/budgets.json:43:      "rationale": "The version 1-4 footprint limits were registered in C03 for the first slice, whose rationale says later features register their own additions. C19 (D046) made the pinned Harness engine, a 306 MiB executable and its notices that v2 does not build and cannot strip without breaking its seal, a bundle resource, but bundled it only in fixture builds and registered no footprint for it, so xtask footprint kept measuring a production app without it (35.5 MiB in C24) while the app that ships must carry it. The C24 review found the gap (C24-G3). Version 5 measures what ships and keeps the first slice's allowance for everything else: the limits add exactly the engine's pinned sizes, set from the pin record before this complete package was measured.",
